+### Seamless Loop Timing
+
+For short loop pieces, pick duration and BPM so `DUR * BPM / 60` is an integer number of beats, and make every periodic motion complete a whole cycle within the loop (rotations, chases, camera) — otherwise the loop visibly jumps. Phrase changes landing on multiples of 4 beats read as choreography.
+
+### Pure-PIL Fallback (no NumPy)
+
+The pipeline degrades cleanly to Pillow-only when numpy is absent: `ImageChops.screen` for additive/screen layers, `ImageChops.offset` for camera shake, `Image.effect_noise` for grain, and a bytes-LUT `im.point()` for gamma. Pitfall: `Image.point()` on an RGB image requires 3×256 LUT entries — a 256-entry LUT raises `ValueError: wrong number of lut entries`; pass `LUT * 3`.
+
+### GIF Delivery Size
+
+Chat inline-image delivery caps around 5 MB. Encode the full-quality GIF/MP4 first, then derive a delivery variant by re-encoding the GIF itself (`fps` down + `scale` down + second palettegen/paletteuse pass) instead of re-rendering frames.
+
